OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny fog soon clearing this
OL,6,Fmorning. Otherwise it will be dry
OL,7,Facross all parts with variable amounts
OL,8,Fof cloud and some good spells of
OL,9,Fsunshine. Warm.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry.
OL,12,FThen the rest of the night will be dry
OL,13,Fwith variable amounts of cloud and
OL,14,Fsome lengthy clear periods. Light
OL,15,Fwinds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FAll parts will have a dry day
OL,18,Falthough a fair amount of high cloud
OL,19,Faround. Brisk southeasterly breeze
OL,20,Falong the east coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
